The '''Urodel'''<ref name="TLJVD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> were [[Sentience|sentient]] [[amphibian]]s. [[Bollie Prindel]] and [[Vetch]] were members of this [[species]],<ref name="TFAVD" /> as was an individual present in [[CoCo Town]] on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Stop, Thief">{{IDWAdventuresCite-2017|issue=1|story=Tales from Wild Space: Stop, Thief!}}</ref> [[Nooa]] was an Urodel who trained as a [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Last Call">''[[Star Wars: Tales from the Galaxy's Edge – Last Call]]''</ref>

